---
import Button from "../ui/Button.astro";
import Heading from "../ui/Heading.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import Hobbies from "../portfolio/Hobbies.astro";
import { SITE } from "../../config/site";
import ProjectsMarquee from "./ProjectsMarquee.astro";
import SkillsMarquee from "./SkillsMarquee.astro";
import ProfileAvatar from "./ProfileAvatar.astro";

const  {
  profileImage = "/images/victor-ruiz-reyes-bucaramanga.jpeg",
  profileAlt = "Foto de perfil de Victor Ruiz Reyes",
  profileLink = "/about-me",
  profileTitle = "Desarrollador Frontend",
  profileName = "Victor Ruiz Reyes",
  getLinkRick = "https://next-phi-blue.vercel.app/",
  email = SITE.email,
  whatsappLink = SITE.whatsapp,
} = Astro.props;
---

<section
  class="scroll-m-16 px-8 max-sm:px-4 py-8"
  id="home"
  aria-label="Perfil profesional e introducción"
>
  <div
    class="mx-auto mb-4 h-96 w-full max-w-7xl rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-mint-300 dark:from-mint-600 to-mint-50 dark:to-mint-200/5 hover:to-mint-300/30 dark:hover:to-mint-600/30 p-[.2rem]  max-md:h-auto"
  >
    <div
      class="group relative z-0 flex h-full items-center justify-center gap-8 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-riptide-100 to-white p-4 transition-all hover:shadow-[0_10px_50px_rgba(99,_102,_241,_0.2)] dark:bg-gradient-to-r dark:from-mint-950 dark:to-zinc-950 dark:overflow-hidden max-md:w-full max-md:gap-3 max-lg:gap-2 max-sm:flex-col dark:before:[background-image:radial-gradient(circle,_rgba(99,102,241)_0,_rgba(30,27,75)_100%)] before:[background-image:radial-gradient(circle,_rgba(165,180,252)_0,_rgba(199,210,254)_100%)] before:absolute before:left-65 before:top-10 before:h-[40%] before:aspect-square before:rounded-full before:blur-3xl before:opacity-80 before:-z-10 before:transition hover:before:animate-pulse"
    >
      <ProfileAvatar
        src={profileImage}
        alt={profileAlt}
        href={profileLink}
        class="relative z-10 h-[92%] shrink-0 max-md:h-auto max-md:w-40"
      />

      <div
        class="flex h-full w-7/12 flex-col justify-center gap-4 p-4 pr-0 max-md:w-full max-md:gap-2"
      >
        <span
          class="relative inline-flex items-center text-xs font-semibold leading-snug dark:text-white text-blacktext max-md:font-medium max-sm:justify-center max-sm:text-center"
        >
          <span
            class="before:mr-2 before:block before:h-1.5 before:w-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-green-400 before:shadow-[0px_0px_0px_3px_rgba(34,_197,_94,_0.5)] before:animate-pulse before:content-['']"
          ></span>
          Actualmente trabajo en Presik y busco implementar nuevas tecnologías en ATC.
        </span>

        <h1
          class="text-4xl font-black leading-none text-blacktext  dark:text-white max-xl:text-3xl max-lg:text-2xl  max-sm:text-center"
        >
          {profileName} 👋
        </h1>
       <p
  class="mb-0 text-lg font-semibold leading-8 text-blacktext dark:text-gray-200 max-xl:text-base"
>
Disfruto crear soluciones que aporten valor. En mi tiempo libre me gustan los videojuegos, el patinaje, el baloncesto y el senderismo.
<br />
Tengo más de <b
  class=" bg-gradient-to-r from-riptide-500 to-mint-500 dark:from-riptide-300 dark:to-mint-200 text-transparent bg-clip-text"
>9 años de experiencia</b> en la creación y administración de sitios y aplicaciones web.
<br />
Actualmente trabajo en <b
  class=" bg-gradient-to-r from-riptide-500 to-mint-500 dark:from-riptide-300 dark:to-mint-200 text-transparent bg-clip-text"
>Presik</b> y me gustaría implementar las nuevas tecnologías en una empresa como <b
  class=" bg-gradient-to-r from-riptide-500 to-mint-500 dark:from-riptide-300 dark:to-mint-200 text-transparent bg-clip-text"
>ATC</b>.
Aquí puedes ver algunos de mis <b
  class=" bg-gradient-to-r from-riptide-500 to-mint-500 dark:from-riptide-300 dark:to-mint-200 text-transparent bg-clip-text"
>desarrollos</b>.
<b
  class=" bg-gradient-to-r from-riptide-500 to-mint-500 dark:from-riptide-300 dark:to-mint-200 text-transparent bg-clip-text"
>¡Échales un vistazo!</b>

</p>


        <div class="flex gap-4 max-sm:flex-col max-sm:items-center">
          <Button
            link={"mailto:" + email}
            text="Escríbeme un correo"
            iconName="envelope"
          />
          <Button
            link={whatsappLink}
            text="Mi WhatsApp"
            iconName="whatsapp"
            variant="dark"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div
    class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-2 grid-rows-4 max-sm:gap-3 gap-4 max-md:h-[80vh] max-sm:h-[900px] max-xl:h-[550px] xl:h-[700px] md:grid-cols-4 md:grid-rows-2"
  >
    <div
      class="col-start-2 row-start-2 flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-mint-50 bg-gradient-to-r from-riptide-200 to-mint-200 p-8 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:border-2 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:bg-gradient-radial dark:from-riptide-500 dark:to-mint-500 max-md:gap-0 max-xl:p-5 max-md:p-4 max-lg:gap-1 md:col-start-4"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-col-reverse items-start gap-4 max-md:gap-2">
        <Heading text="Más allá del código" level={3} />
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-y-auto">
        <Hobbies />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="col-start-1 row-start-2 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-mint-300 dark:from-mint-600 to-mint-50 dark:to-mint-200/5 hover:to-mint-300/30 dark:hover:to-mint-600/30 p-[.2rem] transition-all ease-in duration-150 hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(99,_102,_241,_0.4)] z-40 md:col-start-3"
    >
      <div class="h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl dark:bg-zinc-900">
        <div
          class="relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl  bg-gradient-to-tr from-riptide-100 to-white dark:from-transparent dark:bg-gradient-to-bl dark:to-transparent "
        >
          <a
            target="_blank"
            href={getLinkRick}
            aria-label="Ver el repositorio del sitio en GitHub"
          >
            <div
              class="relative flex h-full flex-col gap-8 p-8 dark:before:[background-image:radial-gradient(circle,_rgba(99,102,241)_0,_rgba(30,27,75)_100%)] before:[background-image:radial-gradient(circle,_rgba(165,180,252)_0,_rgba(199,210,254)_100%)] before:absolute before:left-30 before:bottom-30 before:h-[30%] before:aspect-square before:rounded-full before:blur-3xl before:opacity-90 before:transition before:z-0 max-xl:p-5 max-md:p-4 xl:before:bottom-10"
            >
              <div class="z-2">
                <Heading text="Te muestro mi librería de Rick y Morty, un proyecto personal que desarrollé como hobby." level={5} className="!text-[13px] !leading-snug max-md:!text-xs"/>
              </div>

              <Icon
                class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-6 -right-4 size-28 text-mint-500/30 group-hover:animate-pulse ease-in-out max-md:-bottom-5 max-md:size-20"
                name="rick"
                aria-hidden="true"
              />
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="col-span-2 col-start-1 row-start-1 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-mint-300 dark:from-mint-600 to-mint-50 dark:to-mint-200/5  hover:to-mint-300/30 dark:hover:to-mint-600/30 p-[.2rem] md:col-start-3"
    >
      <article
        class="group relative z-0 flex h-full w-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-riptide-100 to-mint-100 p-6 transition hover:shadow-[0_10px_50px_rgba(99,_102,_241,_0.2)] dark:bg-gradient-to-r dark:from-mint-900 dark:to-mint-950 dark:overflow-hidden max-md:p-4 gap-4 max-md:gap-2 max-lg:gap-3 dark:before:[background-image:radial-gradient(circle,_rgba(99,102,241)_0,_rgba(30,27,75)_100%)] before:[background-image:radial-gradient(circle,_rgba(165,180,252)_0,_rgba(199,210,254)_100%)] before:absolute before:left-30 before:-bottom-0 before:h-[80%] before:aspect-square before:rounded-full before:blur-3xl dark:before:opacity-80 before:opacity-30 before:-z-10 before:transition"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 max-md:gap-2">
          <Icon
            class="text-3xl dark:text-white text-mint-500 max-md:text-2xl max-sm:text-sm"
            name="dashboard"
            aria-hidden="true"
          />
          <Heading text="Habilidades" level={3} />
        </div>
        <p class="-mt-3 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-blacktext dark:text-gray-200 max-md:mt-0">
          Mi stack en tres frentes: <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-riptide-500 to-mint-500 bg-clip-text font-black text-transparent dark:from-riptide-300 dark:to-mint-200">frontend</span>, <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-riptide-500 to-mint-500 bg-clip-text font-black text-transparent dark:from-riptide-300 dark:to-mint-200">backend y CMS</span>, y <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-riptide-500 to-mint-500 bg-clip-text font-black text-transparent dark:from-riptide-300 dark:to-mint-200">marketing, nube e IA</span>.
        </p>
        <SkillsMarquee class="-mx-6 flex-1 max-md:-mx-4" />
      </article>
    </div>

    <div
      class="col-span-2 row-span-2 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-mint-300 dark:from-mint-600 to-mint-50 dark:to-mint-200/5 p-[.2rem] hover:to-mint-300/30 dark:hover:to-mint-600/30 md:col-start-1 md:row-start-1"
    >
      <article
        class="group relative flex h-full flex-col justify-start overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-riptide-100 to-white dark:from-mint-950 dark:to-zinc-950 p-8 transition-all hover:shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(99,_102,_241,_0.4)] max-md:p-6 dark:before:[background-image:radial-gradient(circle,_rgba(99,102,241)_0,_rgba(30,27,75)_100%)] before:[background-image:radial-gradient(circle,_rgba(165,180,252)_0,_rgba(199,210,254)_100%)] before:absolute before:left-1/2 before:bottom-30 before:h-[30%] before:aspect-square before:rounded-full before:blur-3xl before:opacity-70 before:transition before:-z-0 hover:before:animate-pulse xl:before:bottom-2/5"
      >
        <a
          href="#projects"
          class="absolute left-0 top-0 z-50 h-full w-full bg-transparent"
          aria-label="Ir a la sección de proyectos"></a>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 max-md:gap-2">
          <Icon
            class="text-3xl dark:text-white text-mint-500 max-md:text-2xl max-sm:text-xl"
            name="code"
            aria-hidden="true"
          />
          <Heading text="Proyectos" level={3}/>
        </div>
        <p
        class="z-2 my-6 text-lg font-semibold leading-6 dark:text-gray-200 text-blacktext max-xl:text-base max-w-[90%] max-md:max-w-[85%]"
      >
        Me encanta <span
          class="bg-gradient-to-r from-riptide-500 to-mint-500 bg-clip-text font-black text-transparent  dark:from-riptide-300 dark:to-mint-200"
          >convertir ideas en proyectos reales.</span
        >
        <br /> Aquí te muestro algunos de los <span
          class="bg-gradient-to-r from-riptide-500 to-mint-500 bg-clip-text font-black text-transparent  dark:from-riptide-300 dark:to-mint-200"
          >desarrollos</span
        > en los que he trabajado, aplicando tecnología, diseño y mucha creatividad.
        <span
          class="bg-gradient-to-r from-riptide-500 to-mint-500  font-black  bg-clip-text text-transparent  dark:from-riptide-300 dark:to-mint-200"
          >¡Échales un vistazo!</span
        >
      </p>
      
        <ProjectsMarquee class="relative z-0 -mx-8 -mb-8 min-h-[280px] flex-1 max-md:-mx-6 max-md:-mb-6" />
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
